(each carries a "Ported from ..." docstring naming its upstream origin):

  backend/rag/graph.py       from rag_core_api/impl/graph/chat_graph.py
  backend/rag/retrieval.py   from rag_core_api/impl/retriever/composite_retriever.py
                             and retriever_quark.py
  backend/rag/prompts.py     from rag_core_api/prompt_templates/* and
                             admin_api_lib/prompt_templates/summarize_prompt.py
                             (ported verbatim)
  backend/rag/rerank.py      from rag_core_api/impl/reranking/flashrank_reranker.py
  backend/rag/vectordb.py    from rag_core_api/impl/vector_databases/qdrant_database.py
  backend/rag/enhance.py     from admin_api_lib/impl/information_enhancer/
                             page_summary_enhancer.py and
                             admin_api_lib/impl/summarizer/langchain_summarizer.py
  backend/rag/chunking.py    from admin_api_lib/impl/chunker/text_chunker.py
  backend/rag/llm.py         from rag_core_lib/impl/llms/llm_factory.py
  backend/rag/storage.py     from rag_core_lib/impl/file_services/s3_service.py
  backend/rag/conf.py        from libs/rag-core-api/.../impl/settings/*
  backend/rag/models.py      status and content-type enums from
                             admin_api_lib/models/status.py and
                             rag_core_lib/impl/data_types/content_type.py
  backend/rag/extract.py     from extractor_api_lib/* (sitemap and Confluence
                             extractors in particular)
  backend/rag/ingest.py      replaces the upstream admin-backend ->
                             document-extractor -> rag-backend ingestion path
  backend/rag/views.py       replaces upstream rag_api.py and admin_api.py
  backend/rag/serializers.py chat request/response shapes from upstream


